    "That didn't go through. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso no se completó. Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That handle is taken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese alias está en uso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn't a tire size. Use the three numbers on the sidewall, like 245 / 40 / 18.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso no es una medida de neumático. Usa los tres números del flanco, como 245 / 40 / 18."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog doesn't list tire size or final drive. Enter the stock ones: the tire size is on the door-jamb sticker, the final drive is in the owner's manual.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El catálogo no indica la medida del neumático ni la relación final. Introduce las de serie: la medida está en la pegatina del pilar de la puerta y la relación final en el manual del propietario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog has no gear ratios for this car, so there is no speed in each gear or cruising rpm to show. The tire comparison below still works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El catálogo no tiene las relaciones de marchas de este coche, así que no hay velocidad por marcha ni régimen de crucero que mostrar. La comparación de neumáticos de abajo sigue funcionando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog has no redline for this car. Enter it from the tachometer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El catálogo no tiene el régimen de corte de este coche. Introdúcelo desde el tacómetro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The entry is saved, but its cost isn't. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
